Third-party components
----------------------
- ygopro-core (edo9300, https://github.com/edo9300/ygopro-core), AGPL-3.0. A git submodule at
  third_party/ygopro-core; we apply the patches in third_party/patches/ when building.
- CardScripts and BabelCDB (Project Ignis, https://github.com/ProjectIgnis), AGPL-3.0. Card scripts and the card
  database, as git submodules; they are not redistributed in this repository.
- third_party/edopro-strings.conf: the Project Ignis English locale file (EDOPro), AGPL-3.0.
- decks/gauntlet/: deck lists from ygo-agent (https://github.com/sbl1996/ygo-agent), MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2024 Hastur. ygo-agent's model is used only as an evaluation opponent and is not redistributed.
- Card embeddings in the release bundle were computed with Qwen3-0.6B (Alibaba Cloud), Apache-2.0, over card text
  from BabelCDB.
- Card images are not included. The web client can optionally show images from YGOPRODeck (https://ygoprodeck.com),
  fetched on demand when the user enables "Card art".

